{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119180616117-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119184208\"/><p>特朗普登上專機，離開深圳。</p><p>中國國家主席習近平、美國總統特朗普、俄羅斯總統普京於周四（19日）下午接近4時30分，在廣東深圳麒麟山莊舉行史上首次中美俄元首面對面會晤。會晤於傍晚接近6時結束，歷時約1小時30分鐘。三人會後未舉行聯合記者會，特朗普和普京相繼離場，前往機場。特朗普乘專機離開深圳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:22.964479+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:06:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.193582+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.193582+00:00","content_hash":"8b2e671ac0f5051eb75c2041bbecfee6325c5eef3faaf6130e070bec220e44c1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}